DEFINE IN-IDDISTR    W 5  N  VALUE 98                                           
                                                                                
%WWDIST19 'IN-' WORK ''                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. TEST JOB                                                              
